      "date_filed": "2021-04-13 14:23:40",
      "description": "MASTER MOTION CALENDAR ON APR-13-2021 IN 206, DEFENDANT CEVIK MEHMET'S MOTION TO CONTINUE TRIAL DATE WAS HEARD. BRYAN VERESCHAGIN, ESQ. APPEARING IN PERSON FOR PLAINTIFFS. SEAN MORIARTY, ESQ. APPEARING VIA COURTCALL FOR DEFENDANT CEVIK MEHMET. JEFFREY BUCK, ESQ. APPEARING VIA COURTCALL FOR DEFENDANT LYFT, INC. JUDGE FENG MADE A DISCLOSURE THAT HE KNOWS MR. MORIARTY. NO OBJECTIONS WERE MADE. ARGUED AND THE COURT GRANTED THE MOTION. THE TRIAL DATE OF 05/24/21 IS CONTINUED TO 06/21/21 IN DEPT. 206 AT 9:30 AM. PARTIES MAY APPEAR BY COURTCALL. AT TRIAL CALL ON 06/21/21, THE COURT INDICATED THAT THIS CASE WOULD BE ASSIGNED TO JUDGE WISS AND WOULD TRAIL ANOTHER CASE MR. VERESCHAGIN HAS SET WITH JUDGE WISS ON 06/21/21. ALL DISCOVERY WILL CLOSE 30 DAYS BEFORE 06/21/21. ORDER SIGNED IN OPEN COURT. MR. VERESCHAGIN WILL SERVE ORDER AS HE RECEIVED A CONFORMED COPY IN COURT. PARTIES WAIVED NOTICE. JUDGE: SAMUEL K. FENG; MATTER NOT REPORTED (206/SKF)",
